                        N-Stack reserves the right to make adjustment and relocate the <span class="proptype"></span>, if need arises
                        due to site constraints or change in town planning.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <!-- 3 -->
                <li style="padding-left:0.5rem; margin-top:20px;">
                    <p style="font-size:22px;">
                        That transferee/allottee agree to pay development charges as and when demanded
                        by the Authority on account of any additional development / up gradation of
                        services or infrastructure.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <!-- ========================= -->
                <!-- PLOT ONLY : 4,5,6 -->
                <!-- ========================= -->
                <!-- 4 -->
                <li class="plotOnly" style="padding-left:0.5rem; margin-top:20px;">
                    <p style="font-size:22px;">
                        Possession fee will be paid by the <span class="proptype"></span> owner (if not paid) at the time of
                        applying possession.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <!-- 5 -->
                <li class="plotOnly" style="padding-left:0.5rem; margin-top:20px;">
                    <p style="font-size:22px;">
                        <u><b>Security Charges.</b></u> Security charges as prescribed by N-Stack will be levied
                        after the possession is opened till the commencement of construction.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <!-- 6 -->
                <li class="plotOnly" style="padding-left:0.5rem; margin-top:20px;">
                    <p style="font-size:22px;">
                        <u><b>Non-utilization Fee.</b></u> After the possession is opened and the owner is
                        required to construct the building (Residential / Commercial), within three
                        years and <u>
                            after transfer transferee be required to construct the building
                            (Residential/Commercial) within 24 months.
                        </u> In case of failure to construct
                        the building, non-utilization fee will be levied as per N-Stack bylaws / Policy
                        till the commencement of construction.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <!-- ========================= -->
                <!-- VILLA ONLY : 4,5 -->
                <!-- ========================= -->
                <!-- 4 -->
                <li class="villaOnly" value="4" style="padding-left:0.5rem; margin-top:20px; display:none;">
